&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;7+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of software and AI engineering related experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Solid fundamentals in &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
