&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience with Postgres/OLTP, CI/CD (Databricks Asset Bundles, GitHub Actions), or analytics/BI.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
