&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will engage with the Solutions Architect to understand the full Use Case Demand Plan for prioritised customers.&lt;/li&gt;
