&lt;p&gt;Forward Deployed Engineering sits at the frontier of Databricks delivery — engineers who embed with enterprise customers to architect and build full-stack data and AI solutions on the platform. The Amsterdam team serves customers across the region undergoing data and AI transformation, and is growing its practice with a focus on delivery excellence and AI-native solutions. More than 10,000 organisations worldwide — including over 50% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data Intelligence Platform.&lt;/p&gt;
