&lt;li&gt;Experience, technical customer-facing and with a background ideally in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Data Science / Generative AI / Machine Learning,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;but will also consider Data Warehousing or Data Engineering.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be working in the following any of the following vertical sectors:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
