&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Databricks is the data and AI company. Founded by the original creators of Apache Spark™, Delta Lake and MLflow, Databricks simplifies data and AI so data teams can collaborate and innovate faster. More than five thousand organizations worldwide —including Shell, Conde Nast and Regeneron — rely on Databricks as a unified platform for massive-scale data engineering, collaborative data science, full-lifecycle machine learning and business analytics. Venture-backed and headquartered in San Francisco (with offices around the globe) Databricks is on a mission to help data teams solve the world&#39;s toughest problems. To learn more, follow Databricks on&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/databricks&quot;&gt; Twitter&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt; LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/databricksinc/&quot;&gt; Facebook&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
