&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2367&quot;&gt;AI Engineering: Working with LLMs and agentic systems, including vector databases, fine-tuning, AI guardrails, and frameworks like LangChain, Hugging Face, or OpenAI APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
