&lt;p&gt;Databricks operates at the leading edge of the Data and AI space with a mission to help companies solve the world&#39;s toughest problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced strategic sales leader to lead our Bangalore based Business Development teams and help us expand our business across the India region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Director, Sales Development, you will be an important contributor to our sales leadership team, building and executing pipeline generation / consumption growth strategies, while coaching and developing our Business Development team members.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will have experience driving pipeline generation leveraging AI, leading sales development teams and working with sales, a partner ecosystem and marketing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take the primary leadership role in developing an outstanding team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and shape the strategy for pipeline generation within India in collaboration with the India Leadership team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create innovative strategies to accelerate new customer acquisition and consumption growth&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage your team&#39;s pipeline target and be active in coaching team members to be successful&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with cross - functional regional leaders to maximise the contribution of the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze team performance and funnel data to identify and fix inefficiencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adopt and implement AI strategy for pipe generation and daily workflows of your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 3-4 years experience as a Sales Development manager with consistent overachievement against quota&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a quota carrying, end to end sales role with consistent overachievement against quota&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in developing top talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in leading through change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in using Salesforce and Outreach.io, additional experience with AI tools will be advantageous&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in sales processes focused around value selling, prospecting and opportunity qualification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to adapt to a fast paced environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for cloud, big data and AI&lt;/li&gt;
