&lt;li&gt;Develop and deepen understanding of and expertise in Data Engineering, a foundational domain in the data and AI industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, shape, and drive the future of data processing, data applications, and data pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
