&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2367&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ebdffd0e72181e9c4303cddd2342f030&quot; class=&quot;editor-module-hl-green-solid&quot;&gt;3+ years in a&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;data engineering, data science, technical architecture, or similar pre-sales/consulting role&lt;/li&gt;
