&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The location for the role should be in the Madrid region (i.e. within a commutable distance for a hybrid schedule).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Look at all the apps you have on your mobile. Many of these are built by customers that are within our Digital Natives and Scaleup patch and are using Databricks to support their business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We provide a user-friendly and intuitive platform that makes it easy to turn insights into action and foster a culture of creativity, experimentation, and continuous improvement. You will be an essential part of this mission, using your technical expertise to demonstrate how our Data Intelligence Platform can help customers solve their complex data challenges. &lt;br&gt;At Databricks, our core values are at the heart of everything we do; creating a culture of proactiveness and a customer-centric mindset guides us to create a unified platform that makes AI and analytics accessible to everyone. We aim to inspire our customers to make informed decisions that push their business forward.&lt;/p&gt;
