&lt;p&gt;This role is remote-friendly, candidates from any remote U.S. location are welcome to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a University Recruiter (Contract), you will be an integral part of the early career hiring process. You will focus on supporting Engineering hiring teams &amp;amp; leaders through the intern program, full cycle recruiting, and recruiting events &amp;amp; programs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise and partner with managers and directors in our Engineering organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-cycle recruiting from source to close for technical intern and new grad candidates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with UR Team to assist with team matching and allocation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage high volume while maintaining excellent candidate experience and data integrity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with senior engineering leaders as a talent advisor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of sourcing, screening, and closing early in career technical candidates while providing top-tier candidate experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A focus on efficient and effective recruiting processes that support a high volume, diverse candidate pool&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI builder mindset: you&#39;re using AI for personal productivity and programs at scale - you&#39;re excited to work with the team to discover how we can improve!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
